# Analytics and Observability

## Measurement goals

Measure only behavior that helps improve the B2B website.
Useful events include:
- product viewed
- category selected
- search used
- filter applied
- quote form started
- quote form submitted
- quote form submission failed
- journal article viewed

## Privacy

Use analytics in a privacy-conscious way and follow the requirements that apply to the deployment and audience.
Do not collect unnecessary personal data.

## Naming

Use stable, human-readable event names.
Do not send arbitrary payloads full of personal information.

## Errors

Production errors should be diagnosable without exposing sensitive information to visitors.

## Conversion principle

Analytics should support product discovery and B2B enquiry optimization.
Do not turn the site into a tracking-heavy experience.
